4323..4398 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop: the round trip at a variable, by"
4399..4477 Comment "/// induction over the words. The result type reads the word the fold descends"
4478..4552 Comment "/// on, so each arm answers it at its letter and the recursive call at the"
4553..4625 Comment "/// rest: `sect[<](q)` relates `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along"
4626..4706 Comment "/// `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷ spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))`"
4707..4786 Comment "/// runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷"
4787..4863 Comment "/// back(loop) ∷ q` the arms compose to `cong(loopOn, cong(unloopOn, p))`,"
4864..4938 Comment "/// whose functions compose to the identity under the words\' rules, so the"
4939..4982 Comment "/// chain is `p` itself, the answer at `q`."
